            "review_title": "Review at Les Deux Filles",
            "review_text": "Huyền T\n114 contributions\n0\nAll white lovely and grace place\nMar 2017 • Friends\nWhen I walked by Ngu Xa street, it's near by Truc Bach lake, i saw this white cute coffee house. With white tone, this place looks so grace. And i was impressed by huge bookshelves on the 2nd floor. \nAnd i support you should order the hamburger. It's so yummy with special sauce. And i ordered an iceblended with the candycotton, it's called floaty Iceblended, it sounds cute, heinz? \nAfter all, it's a very lovely place\nRead more\nWritten March 24, 2017",
