            "review_text": "Vu B\n5 contributions\n0\nLovely Place\nMar 2017 • Friends\nThis is an occassion when I was passing by and saw a white coffee house, it's beautiful, grace in white. Then, I was impressed by the 2nd floor with a huge bookshelves and the lights. This is really a lovely and cute place to drink or eat. By the way, the hamburger tastes so yummy with specially sauce. The service is nice. So, this coffee house made my day with all comfortable, satisfied and excellent hamburger\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 20, 2017",
